        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e92f2bd2e4b04d679af6d6599cc1190b",
      "statement": "ZoneMinder entrypoint (entrypoint.sh) waits for MariaDB on port 3306, initializes the database schema from zm_create.sql on first run, enables ZM_OPT_USE_EVENTNOTIFICATION, and configures MQTT settings in zmeventnotification.ini using MQTT_HOST, MQTT_USER, MQTT_PASSWORD from environment.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L25-L55",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:abed1790b9d7c2890c166042381b8b774e5bc7a89bac7f4c568f93a6d2c57d37:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L75-L95",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9783d197a20229b135ee3a4114615c8cde9890c634a3f1bc98fad31e0ed1f527:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d14d7b69fe994fcbb4c36c7e8ffd4462",
      "statement": "ZoneMinder entrypoint also rewrites secrets.ini to set ZM_USER, ZM_PASSWORD, and generate MLAPI_SECRET_KEY, and adjusts the portal URL from https://portal/ to http://zoneminder/.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L101-L118",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0bca0cb6f0054e294eff2f066b8eb57a824621cad5dd0ca66e0353e270c4ca02:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3deb899a63c04c70a86fa777b635f055",
      "statement": "docker-compose.yml defines no depends_on for any service, so all three containers start in parallel; startup ordering is enforced only inside entrypoint.sh, which blocks on netcat -z ${ZM_DB_HOST} 3306 until MariaDB accepts TCP connections before initializing the database and launching services.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docker-compose.yml",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:c784a3df210ae4d63125ab022d859ea2ae57bf05f3dc385b0c4d642cfb9acf33"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://entrypoint.sh#L41-L45",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:278c41b33aeb8c84b39873b8496b950e00e6b17f3276d2da341ebd763dd25167:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2bb1daa2ab2942378d4fa1e49f132db5",
      "statement": "Only the ZoneMinder image defines a container healthcheck — HEALTHCHECK --interval=1m --timeout=10s --retries=3 with CMD curl -f http://localhost/zm/ — while neither the compose files nor Dockerfile.mosquitto add healthchecks for the db or eclipse-mosquitto services.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Dockerfile#L136-L139",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bbbdff8b30a14e77cbc5951dbd296728b6b5c789bd4849d08970afbc630c4e77:"
        },
        {
