    {
      "id": "claim_4e2abd73144f43978be0514e90d2b488",
      "statement": "At the end of entrypoint.sh, Apache and ZoneMinder are started via `service apache2 start` and `service zoneminder start`, and the container is kept alive with `tail -f /dev/null`; the direct zmeventnotification.pl launch is commented out.",
